# Google Maps API Key
# 1. Enable 'Maps JavaScript API' and 'Places API' in Google Cloud Console
# 2. Under API restrictions, restrict this key to HTTP referrers (e.g., localhost:5173/*, yourdomain.com/*)
# 3. Create a local '.env' file in this folder and paste your key below:
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=YOUR_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY_HERE
